=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Peladi Shalmohr} at (G-11, inside Mummers Coalition). This will trigger a cutscene in which she'll ask you to go track down a duo of Tarutaru performers known as Tarutaru Sauce.
* Travel to (J-11) and check the **Mischief Marker** to trigger a cutscene with {n:Tuffle-Buffle} and {n:Musto-Rusto}.
* {n:Tuffle-Buffle} will ask you to procure the following ingredients to make an appetizer: {i:Fire Crystal|Fire Crystal|4096}, {i:Popoto|Popoto|619}, and {i:Stick of Selbina Butter|Stick of Selbina Butter|615}.
* Grab the ingredients, head back and trade the ingredients to the **Mischief Marker** for another cutscene.

>**It is a good idea to buy a few of each item, as the NPC may break the items when crafting.**
* **{i:Popoto|Popoto|619}** is purchased from {n:Ansegusele} in {z:Western Adoulin} at (I-11).
* **{i:Selbina Butter|Selbina Butter|615}** is purchased from {n:Chomo Jinjahl} in {z:Windurst Waters} in the Cooking Guild if your cooking is 28+ (Novice) otherwise it must be crafted (or bought on the AH).
* **Note**: {n:Tuffle-Buffle} **may fail** any of the synths in this quest (multiple times), so it is recommended that you purchase a couple extra ingredients.

* Afterwards, {n:Tuffle-Buffle} will ask you to procure the following ingredients to make the main course: {i:Fire Crystal|Fire Crystal|4096}, {i:Dhalmel Meat|Dhalmel Meat|4359}, {i:Olive Oil|Olive Oil|633}, and {i:Black Pepper|Black Pepper|626}. Grab the ingredients and head back to the **Mischief Marker** for another cutscene.
** **{i:Dhalmel Meat|Dhalmel Meat|4359}** is purchased from a {p:Kolshushu} regional vendor.
** **{i:Olive Oil|Olive Oil|633}** is purchased from a {n:Kanil} in {z:Western Adoulin} - (K-8) or from {n:Malfud} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (F-8).
** **{i:Black Pepper|Black Pepper|626}** is purchased from {n:Malfud} in {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} - (F-8).

* Finally, {n:Tuffle-Buffle} will ask you to procure the following ingredients to make a dessert: {i:Fire Crystal|Fire Crystal|4096}, {i:Stick of Selbina Butter|Stick of Selbina Butter|615}, {i:Faerie Apple|Faerie Apple|4363}, {i:Pot of Maple Sugar|Pot of Maple Sugar|627}, and {i:Stick of Cinnamon|Stick of Cinnamon|628}. Grab the ingredients and head back to the **Mischief Marker** for the last cutscene.
** **{i:Selbina Butter|Selbina Butter|615}** is purchased from {n:Chomo Jinjahl} in {z:Windurst Waters} in the Cooking Guild if your cooking is 28+ (Novice) otherwise it must be crafted (or bought on the AH).
** **{i:Faerie Apple|Faerie Apple|4363}** is purchased from {n:Ansegusele} in {z:Western Adoulin} - (I-11) or {n:Kopopo} at the Cooking Guild in {z:Windurst Waters} (E-8).
** **{i:Pot of Maple Sugar|Pot of Maple Sugar|627}** is purchased from {n:Benaige} in {z:Southern San d'Oria} - (F-7) when {p:San d'Oria} at least 2nd place in Conquest or from {n:Chomo Jinjahl} in {z:Windurst Waters} in the Cooking Guild if your cooking is 18+ (Recruit)
** **{i:Stick of Cinnamon|Stick of Cinnamon|628}** is purchased from {n:Kopopo} in the Cooking Guild at {z:Windurst Waters} - (E-8) or from {n:Ghemi Sinterilo} in {z:Kazham} - (G-7).
* {n:Peladi Shalmohr} will appear in the cutscene, sign you on as an apprentice manager with the {p:Mummers' Coalition} and give you a reward of 900 {p:Experience Points}.

